label opening_cutscene (Opening Cutscene)
[style name="Cutscene"]
"Dianthus Core" (Default): You heard me.
"Dianthus Core": Good. Then there is still a road for the light.
"Dianthus Core": Little alchemist… my roots are torn. My name is Dianthus. If I go out, the dark will learn how to bloom.
[signal arg="opening_cutscene_done"]
[end_timeline]
